        "Content": "Exceptional Five Bedroom Detached Residence \n\nKinsella Estates are delighted to present 20 Beechmount, Carnew, Co. Wicklow, an exceptional five-bedroom detached family home situated within a highly sought-after residential development on the outskirts of Carnew.\n\nConstructed in 2002 using timber frame construction and finished to an excellent standard, this impressive residence has been lovingly maintained by its current owners and is presented in superb condition throughout. Offering approximately 144 sq. m. (1,550 sq. ft.) of bright and generously proportioned accommodation, the property has been thoughtfully designed to cater for the needs of modern family living.\n\nEntrance Hall: A bright and welcoming entrance hall featuring attractive timber flooring and decorative coving, creating an inviting first impression. Kitchen / Dining Room: The heart of the home, this spacious kitchen and dining area is perfectly designed for modern family living. Finished with timber flooring, a tiled splashback and decorative coving, the room enjoys an abundance of natural light and opens through double doors onto the rear patio, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor living spaces.\n\nSitting Room: A beautifully proportioned reception room featuring warm timber flooring, elegant coving and a charming solid fuel stove, providing a cosy focal point. Double doors lead through to the dining area, making this an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining. Bedroom 1: A generously sized ground floor bedroom finished with timber flooring, offering excellent flexibility as a guest bedroom, home office or additional family accommodation.\n\nFirst Floor: Master Bedroom: A spacious and comfortable principal bedroom complete with built-in wardrobes and a private ensuite, tastefully finished with a tiled splashback. Bedroom 3: A bright and well-proportioned bedroom finished with timber flooring. Bedroom 4: Another generously sized bedroom featuring built-in wardrobes and ample natural light. Bedroom 5: A versatile bedroom finished with timber flooring, ideal as a child's bedroom, nursery or home office. Family Bathroom: The family bathroom is finished with a tiled splashback and serves the first-floor accommodation.\nOutside: To the rear, the property enjoys a beautifully maintained private garden that is not overlooked, providing an excellent degree of privacy. A generous patio area offers the perfect setting for outdoor dining and entertaining, while a garden shed provides valuable additional storage.\nTo the front, the property overlooks a pleasant open aspect within this highly regarded residential development and benefits from an attractive setting with ample parking.\n\nBeechmount is an exclusive development comprising just 32 detached homes, ideally positioned within easy walking distance of Carnew's excellent range of amenities, including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, pubs, restaurants and a variety of local sporting and recreational facilities.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation, a private rear garden and a superb village location, this outstanding home is perfectly suited to growing families or those seeking a peaceful lifestyle without compromising on convenience.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this exceptional property has to offer.\n\nBER: C3 119668366\nEir Code: Y14 AK13\nHouse size: 144 sq. mt (1550 sq. ft)"
